<title>SPAIN: Spain's ACESA 9-mth attributable up 4.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's ACESA 9-mth attributable up 4.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated results for Spanish motorway toll operator ACESA for the first nine months of 1996 to end-September in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Attributable profit		   18.74    vs    17.95</p>
<p> Net profit				19.01    vs    18.23</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			  32.26    vs    30.87</p>
<p> Cash flow				 32.30    vs    30.84</p>
<p> Operating margin			33.75    vs    32.55</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name Autopistas Concesionarias Espanoles SA.</p>
<p>ACESA said average traffic intensity increased 0.6 percent in the nine-months to September versus the year-earlier period</p>
</text>
